{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_05_beg","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_05","title":"货与人","storyCode":"IW-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9aa764cfb7e64b0e33d30b39e33fd32a14e1dded6a2796d3904f9496e81b0fe6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"郑掌柜先一步截下了名为夜半的窃贼，却被挑山人尚冢横插一脚，夺走酒盏。克洛丝一行也找到老船夫，打算与老鲤会合。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"5上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"山上的风，总是清爽的。\n一个清爽的早晨，总是适合解决一些不清不楚的事情。\n山间小镇刚起炊烟，春雪未散，一老一小，相顾无言。\n只听远方一声击锣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你很久了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁，这家伙......阿灯，先不要轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过你，嗯，原来是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确是出人意料，一个雷姆必拓人，一个从一开始就悄悄蛰伏在尚蜀的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可听不懂啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿灯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"套索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把这些眠兽训练得不错，如果是寻常人，此刻就该倒栽葱扎在地里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不仅能立刻发现背后的陷阱，还能稳稳把绳索踩在脚下......这老头......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，我不难为你一个姑娘家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道你怀里的那只酒盏，是什么东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不关心，也不在乎。问太多的赏金猎人，都是新手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就要怪你自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么得意！小帽！钻头！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然不知道是什么，就老老实实把东西交出来，不要白白遭人利用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你竟然对小帽——！你自找的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无头箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用、用手抓住了？这个距离！？我可是才给弩换过弦的——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"念在你不愿意伤人性命的份上，我给你一个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把这酒盏给我，然后告诉你背后的人：慎行，忌私。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你知道我背后是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知不知道不重要，重要的是，我能在这条路上堵住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我凭什么听你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没得选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己也许逃得掉，但你总不忍心看见，自己饲养的这些小畜生遭了殃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你威胁我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有些身手，可除了摆弄弓弩，也没啥功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大可不必敬酒不吃吃罚酒，混江湖，是要靠眼力识人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实，那个人也没和我说，会有你这样的高手来碍事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我拜托一个人去做一件危险的事，那我也多半不会全盘托出的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外乡人，一份工作而已，何必搭上身家性命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把盏给我，我以镖局的名义担保，那人许你多少钱财，我们双倍奉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，本来就是亏本买卖，义务劳动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是帮朋友忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你这样的荒野流寇，也愿意为朋友两肋插刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像对我们有点意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意做久了，贵人多了，朋友也就少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就老老实实回去做生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，山上的生意是最好做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这三山十七峰几百条山道，哪条道上没有供人歇脚休憩的茶馆驿站，哪条道上......没有我们的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"望姑娘知晓轻重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真不把我放在眼里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然正面开战不是我的风格，但是都被挑衅到这个份上了......对吧，小家伙们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（雷姆必拓语）让这个老家伙知道厉害！我们摸爬滚打这么多年，也不是吃干饭的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执迷不悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是如此，那就得罪——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哪怕有第三个人站在一旁，他也绝对看不清这一步，是怎么踏上前来的。\n只因为这个人擅长走路，擅长爬山。他每天抬步踏步的次数，实在是太多太多。\n一声脆响，地上，青砖碎裂，身前，烟尘蒙蒙，眼旁，是一根朴素无奇的竹木扁担，微微发青。\n远方，又一声击锣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎、怎么......这个人是从哪里......啊，阿灯，别怕，钻头！快到我这里......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你终于上山了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我来找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该来的总要来。躲是躲不完的。你又何必这么着急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小女娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的动作——这根木条是叫扁担来着？他刚才做了什么......把石砖地拍得粉碎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认得他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是你们之间有什么麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间只站着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说的对，那我就是你的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事办完了，我会去找你。但不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小女娃，和你手里护着的玩意，有关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我私仇，别扯上这件大事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多大的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百姓安危，士卒存亡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......自从那年雨夜之后，我很少听你有这样的语气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。你怎么会是个恶人呢。一个侠义心肠的刀客，一个本分做人的掌柜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就让开——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——可我正知道你是这样一个人，所以你不来见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不见我，我去找你，也没有结果。所以我也没有下过山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还给我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......十年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十年前，你就是为了护这只酒盏......看着我儿子死于非命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚冢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小女娃，这没你什么事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你趁我不注意抢了我的货，还敢说没我事了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这货本来也不是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚冢，你昏头了吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没你什么事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚冢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜半","speakerId":"avg_476_blkngt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们最好记住......我一定会把东西抢回来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......郑清钺。你的刀呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在家里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。在家里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那年雨夜，走镖路上，共牺牲了十几号人。其中有一个儿子，一个父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"儿子姓尚，是我的儿子。父亲姓杜，是杜遥夜的亲爹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就不戴刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天大的笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你恨我到现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不恨你，我知道你不是故意的，责任在你，错不在你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“先救货，再救人”，哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可货没了，人也没了，难道还不许我怨你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须向你讨个说法，否则我活不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"郑掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我答应你。酒盏给我。你知道，这只酒盏牵扯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。当年他为这只酒盏而死，今天，我要拿这只酒盏给他陪葬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在山上等你，等你去取刀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g01_yanstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慎师傅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你们怎么先来了？我刚打算去梁府找你们哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤小子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只酒盏被偷了，鲤先生让我们来找您来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有交代过什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他让你们来找我，却没让你们先去找那梁大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们分明是从梁府出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。没让你们找梁洵，说明他心底里已经知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人精，人精，确实是人精。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合叔，回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以她身份而言，礼数周到，名副其实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿意演这番礼数周到，说明还有斡旋余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论她本人做何动作，有何居心。太傅手谕在此，作不得假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是个聪明人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既以官身拜访，她当有所觉察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今两方都如劲弓满弦，一触即发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有在惹出更多口舌非议之前，了结事端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的要让所有人相信，我们的选择能让大炎永除后患，那我们自然得依那四个字——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——光明磊落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
